quicksilver (0.1.5-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Development series after the 0.1.4 release. Not a release: the 0.1.4 tag
    is what a release build identifies itself as, and this tree carries work
    that has not been tagged.

 -- The Quicksilver developers <quicksilver.maintainers@gmail.com>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

quicksilver (0.1.4-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Quicksilver 0.1.4: the OpenCL graphics helper for AMD, NVIDIA and Intel
    cards and the desktop fixes tagged as 0.1.3, which was not released as
    binaries, plus desktop notification fixes. Ubuntu 22.04, Ubuntu 24.04 and
    Windows x64, from public tag v0.1.4.

 -- The Quicksilver developers <quicksilver.maintainers@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:54:15 +0000

quicksilver (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Quicksilver 0.1.3: an OpenCL graphics helper for AMD, NVIDIA and Intel
    cards, in the new quicksilver-gpu package and the Windows installer, and
    desktop fixes. Ubuntu 22.04, Ubuntu 24.04 and Windows x64, from public
    tag v0.1.3.

 -- The Quicksilver developers <quicksilver.maintainers@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:00:33 +0000

quicksilver (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Quicksilver 0.1.2: the Windows installer bundles Tor, the desktop is
